{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:32 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:32 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:32 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"海關義工隊全員起動 發放正能量關懷社區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a3d32a7ddb7e36f115c4055eb27e295/2026-11/afde433c-6a66-49a6-9b8e-d975a94fa3cb.jpg\"/><p>海關義工隊無處不在，於過去的週末分別為本地慈善步行及大型馬拉松活動提供義務支援工作。海關關長陳子達及副關長黃蕙荃更分別擔任不同活動嘉賓，為健兒打氣加油！香港海關上下一心，以實際行動傳遞正能量，將關懷與溫暖帶進社區。</p><img alt=\"海關義工隊全員起動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6419368412ef8905511013a0ddc259d6/2026-11/b99ff6e6-134d-4456-b6ee-f81bd9917fa6.jpg\"/><img alt=\"海關關長陳子達到場打氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7409d2f058d452ccfe1f2217bae966f/2026-11/ba415c26-3de9-4558-8347-75bb1ba7af41.jpg\"/><img alt=\"海關義工隊為馬拉松活動提供義務支援工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20954614bdba85798ecd8d02accdc4d6/2026-11/c99c520a-b760-4838-bba0-5c56cfd1bbcb.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1124a2a1023e32f1045ac562ac73966c/2026-11/ca76b86c-9302-4d88-b739-96a1758f7712.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d741c84b304a3a948413ae345e81841/2026-11/e1d5fedd-8f19-4769-85aa-dc11b525c2ba.jpg\"/><img alt=\"海關為慈善步行活動擔任義工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a07fb6f7e2844ecc27a5920bf6b2163c/2026-11/e451cd8d-faa2-4945-ab9b-1b3e87c3ab27.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:45:47.416608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:32:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:50.217390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:47.710378+00:00","content_hash":"f8276c2548a8b29f708e4c65ffafe8f50e4ccada994a8e1d37edda5a36bbfe44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}